{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\"sec\":\"S01\",\"score\":3,\"wrong\":\"把最初的状态概括成解脱和笃定，遗漏了硬撑着挺背、脚下无力、内心分不清愤怒遗憾与想念的脆弱和混乱。\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S02\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S03\",\"score\":3,\"wrong\":\"没有体现他对自己刚才那些鼓劲的话是否真正相信的怀疑，也漏掉了借闲聊或散步暂时躲避沉重问题的心理。\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S04\",\"score\":3,\"wrong\":\"主要处境和原因正确，但感受概括得偏平静，遗漏了美好无法挽回带来的刺痛、疲惫、仓促，以及反复假设过去可能是在逃避眼前现实。\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S05\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S06\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S07\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S08\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S09\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S10\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S11\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S12\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S13\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"}\n  ],\n  \"story\":4,\n  \"story_note\":\"全曲主线完全一致：离开后怀念曾经的亲近，在孤独与不愿再受委屈之间反复挣扎，最终不因害怕孤独而否定离开的决定，带着对过去的想念继续生活；只是对故土、母亲和共同记忆所承载的归属感着墨较少。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8c2223c2-680f-436d-af1d-73954dc8a6ad", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T203932571742Z", "elapsed_seconds": 282.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T20:44:14.782282+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fb236b926f2e65f75e8ac985454d14c0cfe0606090cdbe668b5fcb53f45ad5d1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256"